WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 3)

4
01:34.359 --> 01:35.359
Come here.

5
01:36.159 --> 01:37.159
What now?

6
01:37.280 --> 01:38.280
Cut the chatter.

7
01:38.760 --> 01:39.760
Get over here.

8
01:43.760 --> 01:45.000
Say what you need to say.

9
01:45.400 --> 01:46.439
I have work to finish.

10
01:46.680 --> 01:48.760
Once I'm done, I have a shift at the restaurant.

11
01:51.480 --> 01:51.799
Hold still.

12
01:51.799 --> 01:52.200
What are you doing?

13
01:52.400 --> 01:53.400
Hey, let go!

14
01:53.920 --> 01:54.920
Don't move.

15
02:20.919 --> 02:22.000
Are you out of your mind?

16
02:22.319 --> 02:23.319
I haven't hit back

17
02:23.719 --> 02:25.719
only out of respect for your position as the boss.

18
02:26.960 --> 02:29.080
But don't mistake me for a pushover.

19
02:30.080 --> 02:31.120
If you keep this up,

20
02:31.719 --> 02:32.960
I swear I'll fight back.

21
02:36.960 --> 02:38.280
Look at you.

22
02:38.680 --> 02:40.159
Completely ungrateful.

23
02:41.199 --> 02:42.759
I saw you cut yourself,

24
02:43.319 --> 02:45.479
so I kindly helped disinfect it and stop the bleeding.

25
02:46.080 --> 02:47.400
Instead of thanking me,

26
02:47.479 --> 02:48.560
you threaten to hit me?

27
02:49.159 --> 02:50.240
It wasn't a snakebite!

28
02:50.400 --> 02:51.760
Did you really have to suck on it?

29
02:58.960 --> 02:59.960
Besides,

30
03:00.318 --> 03:02.775
I haven't even settled that score for what you pulled on me yesterday yet.

31
03:02.800 --> 03:03.800
Get over here!

32
03:04.479 --> 03:05.159
Mingkun!

33
03:05.159 --> 03:05.680
Save me!

34
03:06.159 --> 03:07.439
Is your boss totally insane?

35
03:08.319 --> 03:09.120
It's all right.

36
03:09.240 --> 03:10.320
He's just messing with you.

37
03:13.439 --> 03:15.239
Master P'Aya asked you to join him for lunch.

38
03:18.039 --> 03:19.439
Fine, got it.

39
03:22.199 --> 03:23.319
When I'm done eating,

40
03:23.879 --> 03:25.080
we'll keep playing.

41
03:37.639 --> 03:38.639
Mingkun,

42
03:39.400 --> 03:40.560
please let me leave.

43
03:40.759 --> 03:42.280
I'm terrified that when he comes back,

44
03:42.360 --> 03:42.960
he'll just

45
03:43.000 --> 03:44.240
do something awful to me again.

46
03:45.639 --> 03:46.639
All right.

47
03:46.680 --> 03:48.760
I'll arrange for someone to see you out in a moment.

48
03:58.039 --> 03:59.039
This...

49
03:59.199 --> 04:00.439
this room alone

50
04:01.000 --> 04:02.919
feels bigger than my entire house.

51
04:04.360 --> 04:06.560
The rich truly live in a different world.

52
04:15.919 --> 04:16.920
Hello, Mr. Pao.

53
04:17.399 --> 04:19.959
Mr. Mingkun instructed us to prepare these new clothes for you.

54
04:20.319 --> 04:21.600
As for your old clothes,

55
04:21.800 --> 04:23.576
we'll take them to be professionally laundered.

56
04:23.600 --> 04:24.799
Once they're clean,

57
04:24.800 --> 04:27.160
we'll have someone deliver them directly to your residence.

58
04:27.720 --> 04:28.720
You're too kind.

59
04:29.040 --> 04:30.696
There's really no need to go through the trouble.

60
04:30.720 --> 04:32.000
I can just wear my own clothes.

61
04:32.079 --> 04:34.000
If you insist on wearing your own clothes,

62
04:34.319 --> 04:36.479
you may need to speak with Mr. Mingkun first.

63
04:36.480 --> 04:39.040
I don't have the authority to decide.

64
04:41.920 --> 04:43.120
I'll wear these, then.

65
04:43.680 --> 04:44.680
Very well.

66
04:55.720 --> 04:57.560
I'd better change quickly and get out of here.

67
04:58.639 --> 05:00.240
Once that monster finishes lunch,

68
05:00.920 --> 05:02.240
there will be no escaping him.

69
05:21.439 --> 05:23.679
I hear you're dissatisfied with the new head chef again.

70
05:24.079 --> 05:25.360
What's the issue this time?

71
05:26.199 --> 05:27.199
Nothing.

72
05:27.560 --> 05:28.600
Just not to my taste.

73
05:30.240 --> 05:32.878
As luck would have it, through a friend,

74
05:32.879 --> 05:34.240
I brought in another head chef.

75
05:34.720 --> 05:36.399
His résumé is quite impressive.

76
05:36.959 --> 05:39.439
He'll be preparing our dessert after lunch.

77
05:39.560 --> 05:40.560
Give it a try,

78
05:40.959 --> 05:42.839
and see if it satisfies your discerning palate.

79
05:46.639 --> 05:47.639
Oh, by the way,

80
05:48.360 --> 05:50.240
regarding that livestream sales event,

81
05:50.600 --> 05:51.879
I went over the report.

82
05:52.560 --> 05:54.040
The numbers were remarkable.

83
05:54.720 --> 05:56.040
The board is very pleased.

84
06:03.959 --> 06:05.519
With things going so smoothly,

85
06:06.759 --> 06:09.199
how was your collaboration with that star from Huabo...

86
06:09.879 --> 06:11.759
Li Milan, was it?

87
06:12.240 --> 06:13.399
Did you two get along well?

88
06:14.360 --> 06:15.519
Were there any issues?

89
06:17.680 --> 06:18.840
What could possibly go wrong?

90
06:20.040 --> 06:21.279
It was strictly business.

91
06:22.160 --> 06:23.599
He did his job,

92
06:23.600 --> 06:24.839
and I achieved my goal.

93
06:25.439 --> 06:26.480
A clean transaction.

94
06:26.879 --> 06:27.879
That's good to hear.

95
06:28.079 --> 06:31.240
You know your health comes before anything else.

96
06:32.000 --> 06:33.399
That allergic reaction yesterday—

97
06:34.000 --> 06:35.279
don't let it happen again.

98
06:37.399 --> 06:38.680
You know,

99
06:39.079 --> 06:40.439
my heart isn't in this business.

100
06:41.240 --> 06:42.680
The company affairs,

101
06:43.360 --> 06:45.079
the burden Father left behind,

102
06:45.519 --> 06:47.519
they'll ultimately fall on your shoulders.

103
06:48.560 --> 06:49.878
After all,

104
06:49.879 --> 06:52.639
you're the one Father cherished most since childhood.

105
06:53.759 --> 06:56.079
You're sharp and resourceful.

106
06:57.120 --> 06:59.480
Unlike me, slow to react,

107
06:59.879 --> 07:01.759
already falling behind the times.

108
07:03.959 --> 07:04.959
Cherished me?

109
07:06.800 --> 07:07.800
Fine.

110
07:08.279 --> 07:10.879
You have your artistic pursuits,

111
07:12.319 --> 07:13.920
and I'll oversee the company.

112
07:17.600 --> 07:19.079
As for your private life,

113
07:20.079 --> 07:21.319
fool around all you like,

114
07:21.959 --> 07:23.399
but know your boundaries.

115
07:23.920 --> 07:25.279
Don't cross the line

116
07:25.480 --> 07:26.959
and invite needless trouble.

117
07:28.120 --> 07:30.600
After all, you're somewhat of a public figure.

118
07:31.160 --> 07:32.839
Countless eyes are watching you.

119
07:34.240 --> 07:36.000
Don't let irrelevant people

120
07:36.680 --> 07:38.399
tarnish the group's reputation.

121
07:39.240 --> 07:41.638
Otherwise, the brand image Father built over the years

122
07:41.639 --> 07:44.079
with so much blood and sweat

123
07:44.839 --> 07:45.839
will go down the drain.

124
07:51.600 --> 07:53.319
And that contract—

125
07:53.680 --> 07:55.240
keep its clauses firmly in mind.

126
07:56.199 --> 07:59.120
Otherwise, when the time comes,

127
08:00.519 --> 08:03.319
brotherly affection won't stop me from acting.

128
08:08.079 --> 08:09.079
Don't worry.

129
08:09.680 --> 08:10.680
I know the rules.

130
08:11.399 --> 08:12.639
I won't violate them.

131
08:14.079 --> 08:15.839
I won't give anyone—

132
08:17.160 --> 08:18.279
especially you—

133
08:19.120 --> 08:21.199
an excuse to kick me out.

134
08:35.440 --> 08:36.440
Good.

135
08:37.159 --> 08:38.159
Oh, right.

136
08:38.279 --> 08:40.278
About what I mentioned to you last time,

137
08:40.279 --> 08:43.840
regarding that countryside variety show on modern agriculture,

138
08:44.840 --> 08:46.535
has the group considered title sponsorship?

139
08:46.559 --> 08:47.559
Yeah.

140
08:47.879 --> 08:49.239
The project is still under review.

141
08:49.799 --> 08:51.119
There is interest in sponsorship.

142
08:51.399 --> 08:52.440
However,

143
08:53.000 --> 08:55.519
they still need to find guests who draw ratings.

144
08:56.120 --> 08:58.839
I think if they bring in attractive,

145
08:58.840 --> 09:01.398
buzzworthy everyday guys,

146
09:01.399 --> 09:02.720
it should work quite well.

147
09:41.840 --> 09:43.919
[Do Not Enter] Why is this room so weird?

148
09:53.759 --> 09:54.960
It's freezing in here.

149
09:55.759 --> 09:57.159
What's inside?

150
10:05.639 --> 10:06.840
What are you doing?

151
10:07.000 --> 10:08.398
Oh, it's you!

152
10:08.399 --> 10:09.879
You scared the life out of me.

153
10:11.840 --> 10:12.840
Listen to me carefully.

154
10:13.120 --> 10:15.120
Only Master P'Eng is permitted inside this room.

155
10:15.480 --> 10:17.879
If anyone enters without permission,

156
10:18.120 --> 10:20.039
the punishment will be severe.

157
10:21.559 --> 10:22.799
What happened today

158
10:23.120 --> 10:24.720
must remain strictly confidential.

159
10:25.840 --> 10:26.840
Keep it secret?

160
10:27.039 --> 10:28.200
Secret about what?

161
10:28.480 --> 10:30.399
Keep secret that you ever came near,

162
10:30.440 --> 10:31.840
much less opened this door.

163
10:32.360 --> 10:33.799
I wasn't trying to go in.

164
10:34.240 --> 10:35.440
The note fell off,

165
10:35.679 --> 10:37.360
and I was only trying to stick it back on.

166
10:38.360 --> 10:40.000
So you're saying

167
10:40.279 --> 10:41.720
the door wasn't locked,

168
10:42.000 --> 10:43.000
it was already open?

169
10:43.080 --> 10:43.679
Yeah.

170
10:43.679 --> 10:44.440
It was wide open.

171
10:44.441 --> 10:45.521
It's not like I have a key.

172
10:46.159 --> 10:47.159
In any case,

173
10:47.399 --> 10:48.720
act as if nothing ever happened.

174
10:48.919 --> 10:50.239
Take this secret to your grave.

175
10:50.240 --> 10:51.240
Do you understand?

176
10:51.679 --> 10:52.279
Yeah.

177
10:52.559 --> 10:53.559
Understood.

178
10:53.879 --> 10:56.638
While Master P'Aya and Master P'Eng are in a meeting,

179
10:56.639 --> 10:57.959
I'll smuggle you out immediately.

180
10:58.919 --> 10:59.919
Come with me, quickly.

181
11:00.879 --> 11:01.879
Okay.

182
11:09.600 --> 11:10.759
Mr. Mingkun,

183
11:11.240 --> 11:14.798
that 'severe punishment' you mentioned earlier,

184
11:14.799 --> 11:17.120
what does it actually mean?

185
11:17.320 --> 11:18.600
What if one day that monster—

186
11:18.960 --> 11:19.559
I mean,

187
11:19.840 --> 11:21.038
your master—

188
11:21.039 --> 11:23.039
checks the security footage and finds out?

189
11:23.399 --> 11:24.696
Isn't he obsessed with watching the cameras?

190
11:24.720 --> 11:25.639
In truth,

191
11:25.640 --> 11:27.519
it's not guaranteed that he would punish you.

192
11:27.919 --> 11:29.720
His bark is much worse than his bite.

193
11:30.039 --> 11:31.879
It's usually all thunder and no rain.

194
11:32.240 --> 11:33.359
You don't need to worry so much.

195
11:33.360 --> 11:35.399
At worst, it'll cost some money.

196
11:36.679 --> 11:37.120
Then,

197
11:37.320 --> 11:38.559
that's completely fine!

198
11:38.919 --> 11:40.480
He never paid me wages anyway.

199
11:40.919 --> 11:41.720
I don't have any money,

200
11:41.721 --> 11:42.759
so how could he fine me?

201
11:44.000 --> 11:46.600
Still, everyone who has ever gone inside

202
11:46.960 --> 11:48.039
always ends up...

203
12:07.080 --> 12:07.879
A Pong!

204
12:08.080 --> 12:08.519
Yeah?

205
12:08.520 --> 12:09.919
What are you doing here today?

206
12:10.679 --> 12:11.879
Didn't you take the day off?

207
12:12.200 --> 12:13.200
Oh, no.

208
12:13.279 --> 12:14.559
Pao Bei had an emergency,

209
12:14.639 --> 12:15.678
something urgent came up,

210
12:15.679 --> 12:16.959
so he asked me to cover for him.

211
12:19.080 --> 12:20.239
And this handsome guy...

212
12:20.240 --> 12:21.200
is he a friend of yours?

213
12:21.201 --> 12:22.239
Oh, no.

214
12:22.240 --> 12:22.679
He's just—.

215
12:22.679 --> 12:23.440
That's right, Boss.

216
12:23.679 --> 12:25.200
We were classmates in college.

217
12:25.480 --> 12:26.678
I know what an exceptional cook he is,

218
12:26.679 --> 12:27.440
and that he works here,

219
12:27.441 --> 12:29.481
so I came by specifically to support your business.

220
12:29.679 --> 12:32.360
You look so familiar to me.

221
12:32.919 --> 12:34.615
Weren't you doing a promotional event nearby yesterday?

222
12:34.639 --> 12:35.999
That big celebrity...

223
12:36.000 --> 12:37.279
what's your name again?

224
12:38.080 --> 12:38.840
Yes, Boss.

225
12:38.960 --> 12:40.120
My name is Li Milan.

226
12:40.879 --> 12:41.600
Oh, my goodness!

227
12:41.639 --> 12:42.720
It really is you!

228
12:43.279 --> 12:44.600
A Pong, you little rascal!

229
12:45.000 --> 12:46.918
You have a famous friend like him,

230
12:46.919 --> 12:48.320
and you kept it hidden from me?

231
12:49.559 --> 12:50.480
Welcome, welcome!

232
12:50.559 --> 12:51.759
Please, come inside.

233
12:54.720 --> 12:55.720
Right this way.

234
12:56.960 --> 12:57.480
Have a seat.

235
12:57.480 --> 12:58.120
Clear this table.

236
12:58.120 --> 12:58.679
Pour some water.

237
12:58.759 --> 12:59.759
Here you are.

238
13:05.200 --> 13:05.519
Thank you.

239
13:05.519 --> 13:06.200
Have some water first.

240
13:06.320 --> 13:08.359
Here is our menu.

241
13:08.360 --> 13:09.800
Take a look and see what you'd like.

242
13:10.039 --> 13:12.158
I'll have A Pong cook for you himself today.

243
13:12.159 --> 13:13.080
You won't be disappointed!

244
13:13.080 --> 13:13.799
Boss,

245
13:13.799 --> 13:14.799
no need for a menu.

246
13:15.000 --> 13:16.960
Just let A Pong prepare his specialties.

247
13:17.240 --> 13:18.360
Whatever he makes, I'll eat.

248
13:19.080 --> 13:20.759
I'm good at everything on the menu.

249
13:21.240 --> 13:22.240
Pick for yourself.

250
13:22.960 --> 13:25.440
Oh, he's only joking!

251
13:25.639 --> 13:26.639
That's just how he is.

252
13:26.720 --> 13:29.079
He always banters like this with regulars.

253
13:29.080 --> 13:30.080
Please don't mind him.

254
13:30.279 --> 13:31.840
Let A Pong decide what to prepare.

255
13:32.159 --> 13:34.360
Didn't you always know what I like to eat?

256
13:34.639 --> 13:36.279
My tastes haven't changed over the years.

257
13:36.399 --> 13:37.200
It's still the same old favorites.

258
13:37.320 --> 13:39.120
You just said it's been years.

259
13:39.240 --> 13:41.000
How am I supposed to remember what you like?

260
13:51.320 --> 13:52.320
How about this:

261
13:53.879 --> 13:56.120
cook every single dish on the menu.

262
13:56.240 --> 13:58.279
What? Every single dish?

263
13:58.639 --> 14:00.559
You couldn't possibly finish all that.

264
14:01.000 --> 14:01.879
That doesn't matter.

265
14:01.879 --> 14:02.759
If I can't finish,

266
14:02.759 --> 14:03.559
I'll pack it up to go.

267
14:03.583 --> 14:04.742
"I'll pack it up to go."

268
14:06.679 --> 14:07.959
What is wrong with you today?

269
14:07.960 --> 14:09.120
Did you take the wrong pills?

270
14:09.240 --> 14:10.039
Fix your attitude.

271
14:10.039 --> 14:11.039
Go on.

272
14:11.279 --> 14:12.279
Hurry up.

273
14:14.440 --> 14:15.440
Get cooking,

274
14:15.679 --> 14:17.240
old classmate.

275
14:19.840 --> 14:21.359
Certainly, dear customer.

276
14:21.360 --> 14:23.558
I'll go prepare it for you right now.

277
14:23.559 --> 14:25.120
Thanks for the hard work.

278
14:27.759 --> 14:28.200
Come here.

279
14:28.399 --> 14:28.840
Hurry.

280
14:29.159 --> 14:30.720
Take a photo of me with the star!

281
14:34.039 --> 14:35.039
Say cheese!

282
14:37.440 --> 14:38.840
What a total phony.

283
14:39.360 --> 14:42.120
How did he grow up to be even more irritating than when he was a kid?

284
14:46.120 --> 14:47.120
Great.

285
14:47.519 --> 14:48.519
Just look at him.

286
14:49.720 --> 14:51.240
What's his angle?

287
14:52.279 --> 14:53.839
Did he already recognize me?

288
14:53.840 --> 14:55.200
Is he setting a trap for me?

289
14:57.320 --> 14:58.799
He'll toss his chopsticks aside,

290
14:58.919 --> 15:00.080
claim the food tastes awful,

291
15:01.240 --> 15:02.600
and ruin my culinary reputation!

292
15:04.039 --> 15:05.519
Like I'd let him play me like a fool.

293
15:06.879 --> 15:08.278
He messed with me our entire childhood,

294
15:08.279 --> 15:10.039
and I'm supposed to fall for it as an adult?

295
15:11.120 --> 15:12.200
If his fans

296
15:12.360 --> 15:14.120
ever knew what he was really like in college

297
15:14.399 --> 15:15.679
and still adored him,

298
15:15.840 --> 15:17.480
I'd call him my daddy.

299
15:18.879 --> 15:19.600
What are you doing?

300
15:19.720 --> 15:20.720
Why are you daydreaming?

301
15:22.000 --> 15:23.176
With all these dishes, why aren't you moving?

302
15:23.200 --> 15:24.200
Get cracking already!

303
15:25.240 --> 15:26.440
Boss,

304
15:26.720 --> 15:28.439
you really expect me to make all this alone?

305
15:28.440 --> 15:29.638
Aren't you going to help me?

306
15:29.639 --> 15:32.359
The big star specifically asked for you to cook.

307
15:32.360 --> 15:33.439
I just asked him.

308
15:33.440 --> 15:34.758
He seems to be from Chuanzhou.

309
15:34.759 --> 15:35.878
He loves bold, heavy flavors.

310
15:35.879 --> 15:38.200
Make sure to load on the extra chili!

311
15:39.080 --> 15:40.080
Yeah.

312
15:42.080 --> 15:43.080
Listen, kid,

313
15:43.879 --> 15:45.398
put your heart into this.

314
15:45.399 --> 15:47.200
If he enjoys the food

315
15:48.000 --> 15:49.200
and leaves happy,

316
15:49.399 --> 15:52.279
all he has to do is post a few photos online.

317
15:52.720 --> 15:54.879
Think of the free publicity!

318
15:55.159 --> 15:57.320
Our place might blow up overnight.

319
15:59.120 --> 16:00.120
Do an exceptional job.

320
16:00.799 --> 16:03.519
It doesn't matter if we break even today.

321
16:05.799 --> 16:07.679
Since you're so close with him,

322
16:08.840 --> 16:11.080
put in a good word for us.

323
16:11.320 --> 16:12.320
Mm-hmm.

324
16:12.799 --> 16:13.759
Now hurry up and get cooking.

325
16:13.759 --> 16:14.200
Sure.

326
16:14.200 --> 16:15.039
Make it fantastic, got it?

327
16:15.080 --> 16:15.879
Right.

328
16:15.879 --> 16:16.879
Give it your all.

329
16:17.480 --> 16:19.840
I'll do an unforgettable job.

330
16:22.840 --> 16:24.600
Loves spicy food, does he?

331
16:25.440 --> 16:28.960
I'll make sure this meal is seared into your memory forever.

332
17:01.600 --> 17:02.840
Did you see my brother off?

333
17:03.240 --> 17:03.799
Yes.

334
17:03.800 --> 17:05.800
Master P'Aya has already left for the art gallery.

335
17:10.000 --> 17:11.799
He barely visits once in a blue moon.

336
17:12.519 --> 17:13.920
How is it that of all times,

337
17:14.519 --> 17:16.079
the exact moment I bring someone home,

338
17:16.400 --> 17:17.480
he suddenly turns up?

339
17:18.799 --> 17:20.399
Could he be having someone spy on me?

340
17:20.400 --> 17:23.400
That is why I keep reminding you to stay alert.

341
17:31.039 --> 17:32.160
The more he acts like this,

342
17:32.880 --> 17:34.160
the more I want to push back.

343
17:37.200 --> 17:38.400
Where's the kid?

344
17:39.599 --> 17:40.720
He...

345
17:40.839 --> 17:42.159
he is still in the garden,

346
17:42.160 --> 17:43.759
finishing his mother's tasks for today.

347
17:47.119 --> 17:49.640
Send him to my room.

348
17:51.119 --> 17:52.119
Young Master,

349
17:52.880 --> 17:54.518
noticing your exhaustion lately,

350
17:54.519 --> 17:55.720
I took the liberty

351
17:56.039 --> 17:57.440
of booking Masseur Chen

352
17:57.720 --> 17:59.480
to help you unwind with a massage.

353
17:59.640 --> 18:02.119
He is already waiting outside your room.

354
18:02.680 --> 18:03.680
Fine, then.

355
18:05.559 --> 18:06.719
I'll enjoy the massage first.

356
18:10.440 --> 18:12.799
That kid has some serious muscle.

357
18:13.799 --> 18:15.680
Nearly threw my back out.

358
18:18.599 --> 18:20.240
Once I'm done relaxing,

359
18:20.880 --> 18:22.520
I'll take my sweet time dealing with him.

360
18:38.279 --> 18:39.279
Boss P'Eng,

361
18:39.559 --> 18:41.000
is this pressure all right?

362
18:41.519 --> 18:42.519
Yeah.

363
18:43.039 --> 18:44.039
It's fine.

364
18:46.319 --> 18:47.359
A little lighter, please.

365
18:48.200 --> 18:49.559
Right away, sir.

366
18:54.519 --> 18:55.679
What are you chuckling about?

367
18:56.559 --> 18:57.599
I was just thinking...

368
18:58.000 --> 19:00.160
Boss P'Eng, your pressure tolerance

369
19:00.400 --> 19:02.440
isn't nearly as high as that star's last time.

370
19:03.599 --> 19:05.720
He looked so fair and delicate,

371
19:05.839 --> 19:07.599
yet he could really handle intense pressure.

372
19:08.720 --> 19:09.759
Oh?

373
19:10.000 --> 19:11.000
And how did it go?

374
19:11.440 --> 19:13.319
How did he like our technique?

375
19:14.559 --> 19:16.720
He must have been satisfied.

376
19:16.839 --> 19:18.559
When I arrived,

377
19:18.799 --> 19:20.759
he had already received a full round of massage.

378
19:20.920 --> 19:23.960
His entire body was slathered in our new soy sauce.

379
19:24.839 --> 19:25.999
It was quite amusing, really.

380
19:27.799 --> 19:29.400
Covered in soy sauce?

381
19:29.960 --> 19:31.040
What are you talking about?

382
19:31.079 --> 19:32.079
Explain yourself clearly.

383
19:32.359 --> 19:33.359
Here you go.

384
19:33.480 --> 19:34.000
Thank you.

385
19:34.200 --> 19:35.200
You're welcome.

386
19:36.359 --> 19:37.279
Boss, we're taking off!

387
19:37.319 --> 19:38.479
Take care! Come again soon!

388
19:38.480 --> 19:39.160
Bye-bye.

389
19:39.440 --> 19:40.440
Bye!

390
19:49.039 --> 19:50.039
Boss,

391
19:50.279 --> 19:51.999
are you closing up shop?

392
19:52.000 --> 19:53.558
What kind of talk is that?

393
19:53.559 --> 19:55.680
You ordered every single dish on our menu.

394
19:56.160 --> 19:57.879
How could we possibly cater to anyone else?

395
19:57.880 --> 19:58.680
Besides,

396
19:58.681 --> 20:00.758
you're our distinguished VIP.

397
20:00.759 --> 20:02.439
Today, we're dedicated exclusively to you.

398
20:02.799 --> 20:03.599
Boss,

399
20:03.600 --> 20:04.720
that's not what I intended.

400
20:05.079 --> 20:07.240
Why not have A Pong prepare fewer dishes?

401
20:07.440 --> 20:09.015
I can't get in the way of your business.

402
20:09.039 --> 20:09.720
Not at all.

403
20:09.721 --> 20:10.801
It's no problem at all.

404
20:27.759 --> 20:28.759
A Pong!

405
20:28.799 --> 20:30.399
Is business this booming this afternoon?

406
20:30.599 --> 20:31.599
So many orders!

407
20:31.799 --> 20:33.159
Did you finish what you had to do?

408
20:35.319 --> 20:37.200
Pretty much.

409
20:37.880 --> 20:38.839
What was it?

410
20:38.839 --> 20:39.839
Acting all mysterious.

411
20:40.519 --> 20:41.519
Give me the details.

412
20:44.839 --> 20:46.199
You made all these dishes,

413
20:46.200 --> 20:47.320
why haven't you served them?

414
20:47.640 --> 20:48.640
Leave them there.

415
20:48.680 --> 20:49.760
They're all for one person.

416
20:50.319 --> 20:51.000
Huh?

417
20:51.279 --> 20:52.279
Just one person?

418
20:52.920 --> 20:54.599
You made so much food. Can he even eat all that?

419
20:55.279 --> 20:56.839
Go out and see for yourself.

420
20:57.079 --> 20:58.079
Hey.

421
20:58.279 --> 20:59.400
What's with the clothes?

422
20:59.920 --> 21:01.359
Dressed so sharply in the kitchen—

423
21:01.960 --> 21:02.960
did you strike gold?

424
21:06.880 --> 21:07.919
If it gets crowded,

425
21:07.920 --> 21:09.720
dressing nicely might attract some followers,

426
21:10.000 --> 21:11.480
which could boost business here too.

427
21:12.200 --> 21:13.520
I'll take them out for you, then.

428
21:15.599 --> 21:16.839
How bizarre.

429
21:17.559 --> 21:19.680
Since when can that guy afford such high-end threads?

430
21:20.079 --> 21:23.160
Looks like there's a new development.

431
21:27.720 --> 21:28.799
Food is here!

432
21:29.240 --> 21:30.880
It's Milan from yesterday.

433
21:31.519 --> 21:32.720
What is he doing here?

434
21:33.440 --> 21:35.120
And ordering all these dishes for himself?

435
21:38.640 --> 21:39.240
Whoa!

436
21:39.240 --> 21:40.240
Watch it!

437
21:40.640 --> 21:41.880
Take it easy.

438
21:42.119 --> 21:43.640
So clumsy!

439
21:44.119 --> 21:45.960
What if you spilled soy sauce on our guest?

440
21:46.079 --> 21:47.079
It's fine.

441
21:47.359 --> 21:48.359
Soy sauce...

442
21:49.200 --> 21:51.279
seems to love sticking to my body anyway.

443
21:56.160 --> 21:56.720
Please,

444
21:57.119 --> 21:59.559
taste it while it's piping hot.

445
21:59.880 --> 22:01.720
If it suits your palate,

446
22:02.079 --> 22:04.720
I have a small favor to ask.

447
22:06.640 --> 22:07.279
Boss,

448
22:07.599 --> 22:08.640
no need to be polite.

449
22:08.799 --> 22:10.439
Just tell me what you need.

450
22:10.440 --> 22:12.838
Could you perhaps give our humble restaurant

451
22:12.839 --> 22:15.640
a recommendation on your social media?

452
22:16.359 --> 22:17.519
Of course, no problem at all.

453
22:17.759 --> 22:19.479
Even if just for A Pong's sake,

454
22:19.480 --> 22:20.480
I'd gladly recommend it.

455
22:20.759 --> 22:22.558
Not to mention you closed the whole restaurant for me.

456
22:22.559 --> 22:24.240
It's only right that I do.

457
22:24.599 --> 22:25.000
That's fantastic!

458
22:25.079 --> 22:26.160
Thank you so very much!

459
22:26.559 --> 22:27.480
- Please, dig in. - Don't mention it.

460
22:27.519 --> 22:27.920
Mm.

461
22:27.920 --> 22:28.920
It's delicious.

462
22:29.400 --> 22:30.400
Enjoy.

463
22:34.519 --> 22:35.519
Mingkun!

464
22:35.680 --> 22:36.559
Mingkun, where are you?

465
22:36.560 --> 22:38.200
What are your orders, Young Master?

466
22:38.440 --> 22:39.440
Where is that kid?

467
22:39.640 --> 22:40.279
Bring him here.

468
22:40.279 --> 22:41.039
I have things to ask him.

469
22:41.079 --> 22:41.960
Young Master,

470
22:41.961 --> 22:44.400
he should still be working in the garden.

471
22:44.559 --> 22:45.896
Is there something you need him for?

472
22:45.920 --> 22:46.519
Tell me,

473
22:46.720 --> 22:48.360
did you know our brand ambassador, Milan,

474
22:48.680 --> 22:51.519
was attacked during a scheduled massage and covered head-to-toe in soy sauce?

475
22:51.519 --> 22:53.039
- Were you aware of this? - What?

476
22:53.079 --> 22:54.319
Such a thing happened?

477
22:54.519 --> 22:54.960
Young Master,

478
22:54.961 --> 22:56.295
this is the first I'm hearing of it.

479
22:56.319 --> 22:57.599
How do you do your job?

480
22:58.039 --> 22:59.616
If Masseur Chen hadn't mentioned it to me,

481
22:59.640 --> 23:00.879
I wouldn't have known our own ambassador

482
23:00.880 --> 23:02.680
was so thoroughly humiliated on our own turf!

483
23:03.079 --> 23:04.079
I'm sorry, Young Master.

484
23:04.200 --> 23:05.760
This is truly a grave lapse on my part.

485
23:05.960 --> 23:07.040
I'll investigate right away

486
23:07.079 --> 23:08.335
and find out who is behind this.

487
23:08.359 --> 23:09.359
No need to investigate.

488
23:10.880 --> 23:12.880
It was definitely that crude friend of Pao Bei's!

489
23:13.680 --> 23:14.680
Go find Pao Bei right now

490
23:15.319 --> 23:16.920
and tell him to cough up his friend!

491
23:17.119 --> 23:17.680
Young Master,

492
23:18.039 --> 23:19.358
it's broad daylight,

493
23:19.359 --> 23:20.359
and without any evidence,

494
23:20.640 --> 23:22.720
seizing someone like this might not be wise.

495
23:24.839 --> 23:25.839
Evidence?

496
23:27.440 --> 23:28.560
Let me spell it out for you:

497
23:29.039 --> 23:31.159
that night, he gave me flowers out of nowhere.

498
23:31.160 --> 23:32.200
It all makes sense now.

499
23:32.920 --> 23:34.000
His target was never me.

500
23:34.160 --> 23:35.640
He thought Milan was inside that car!

501
23:36.279 --> 23:38.039
Oh, yes, Young Master.

502
23:38.359 --> 23:40.440
There was indeed a slight mix-up with the vehicles.

503
23:40.640 --> 23:42.758
Still, I fail to see

504
23:42.759 --> 23:44.200
what this has to do with his friend.

505
23:45.160 --> 23:46.519
Do you have rocks in your head?

506
23:47.279 --> 23:48.815
He assumed I was the one inside my car,

507
23:48.839 --> 23:49.959
so he tailed it all the way!

508
23:50.079 --> 23:51.815
Because I reported him for selling illegal lottery tickets,

509
23:51.839 --> 23:53.640
he held a grudge and wanted revenge on me.

510
23:54.640 --> 23:55.920
And by pure mistake,

511
23:56.599 --> 23:58.119
he assaulted our talent Milan instead!

512
23:59.079 --> 24:00.518
Oh!

513
24:00.519 --> 24:01.640
I see!

514
24:01.960 --> 24:03.320
Brilliant deduction, Young Master.

515
24:05.640 --> 24:08.640
So go find Pao Bei right now,

516
24:09.160 --> 24:10.840
and make him tell you where his friend is!

517
24:12.160 --> 24:13.480
I'm settling that score today.

518
24:14.319 --> 24:16.680
Touching my people on my territory—

519
24:16.920 --> 24:18.319
he must have a death wish!

520
24:20.960 --> 24:21.976
What are you standing there for?

521
24:22.000 --> 24:23.280
Do you need a formal invitation?

522
24:23.440 --> 24:24.440
Young Master...

523
24:24.920 --> 24:25.240
I...

524
24:25.440 --> 24:28.000
Pao Bei already went back to his restaurant job.

525
24:28.640 --> 24:29.960
Back to the restaurant?

526
24:32.279 --> 24:33.279
The restaurant...

527
24:48.559 --> 24:49.559
Good.

528
24:51.279 --> 24:52.279
Very good.

529
24:55.359 --> 24:56.359
Move.

530
24:57.000 --> 24:58.599
Take me to that dump where they work.

531
25:00.240 --> 25:03.039
Today, I'm taking them both down!

532
25:03.079 --> 25:05.000
Young Master!

533
25:19.519 --> 25:20.720
Hello? Anyone here?

534
25:30.240 --> 25:31.798
Sorry, folks.

535
25:31.799 --> 25:33.400
We're closed for private dining today.

536
25:37.440 --> 25:38.680
Are you sure this is the place?

537
25:39.519 --> 25:40.558
The address is correct, Young Master.

538
25:40.559 --> 25:41.640
Don't fret, let me ask.

539
25:43.359 --> 25:44.240
Excuse me, Boss.

540
25:44.241 --> 25:45.440
We're not here to eat.

541
25:45.599 --> 25:46.719
In your kitchen,

542
25:46.720 --> 25:48.318
is there a young man named Pao Bei

543
25:48.319 --> 25:49.160
working here?

544
25:49.319 --> 25:50.439
Pao...

545
25:50.440 --> 25:51.839
Pao Bei?

546
25:52.119 --> 25:53.399
He took the day off today. He's not here.

547
25:53.400 --> 25:55.119
What do you need him for?

548
25:55.279 --> 25:56.559
I can pass along a message.

549
25:58.640 --> 25:59.440
Young Master,

550
25:59.640 --> 26:00.959
he says he isn't here.

551
26:00.960 --> 26:01.960
Should we...

552
26:04.759 --> 26:05.559
Open the door.

553
26:05.560 --> 26:08.118
I told you, we're not open for business today.

554
26:08.119 --> 26:09.199
Please come back another day.

555
26:09.200 --> 26:10.400
I said open the door.

556
26:18.799 --> 26:21.078
I said we're closed!

557
26:21.079 --> 26:22.640
Open the door!

558
26:24.200 --> 26:25.200
Young Master!

559
26:26.559 --> 26:27.000
Young Master,

560
26:27.000 --> 26:27.920
let's calm down.

561
26:27.920 --> 26:28.920
Out of my way!

562
26:33.160 --> 26:34.160
Boss P'Eng?

563
26:43.079 --> 26:44.079
Are you all right?

564
26:45.480 --> 26:46.279
What are you doing here?

565
26:46.279 --> 26:46.680
Young Master!

566
26:46.681 --> 26:48.039
Why were you so reckless?

567
26:52.880 --> 26:54.079
Why are you here too?

568
26:56.160 --> 26:58.279
Did you come to catch him too?

569
26:58.559 --> 26:59.559
Catch someone?

570
27:01.119 --> 27:02.000
Catch who?

571
27:02.001 --> 27:03.240
You're really something else.

572
27:03.420 --> 27:05.275
Getting pushed around and keeping quiet about it.

573
27:05.319 --> 27:09.342
I came to nail the bastard who rubbed soy sauce all over you during your massage!

574
27:12.799 --> 27:14.079
Isn't that why you're here?

575
27:14.519 --> 27:15.759
Wait, Mr. Milan,

576
27:15.920 --> 27:18.480
did you order this entire table of food by yourself?

577
27:19.799 --> 27:21.160
Oh, yeah.

578
27:21.359 --> 27:22.639
I might have ordered a bit much.

579
27:22.640 --> 27:23.758
I can't finish it alone.

580
27:23.759 --> 27:24.559
Why don't you join me?

581
27:24.599 --> 27:25.599
The food is really good.

582
27:25.880 --> 27:26.960
Don't mind if I do.

583
27:28.000 --> 27:28.519
Young Master.

584
27:28.559 --> 27:29.559
Right this way.

585
27:30.839 --> 27:31.839
Over here.

586
27:38.880 --> 27:39.680
Have some water.

587
27:39.759 --> 27:40.759
Pardon the intrusion.

588
27:44.240 --> 27:45.640
How did he track us down here?

589
27:51.359 --> 27:52.519
Hurry.

590
27:54.519 --> 27:54.960
Boss,

591
27:54.960 --> 27:55.960
yeah?

592
27:56.039 --> 27:58.079
didn't you just say they took the day off

593
27:58.799 --> 27:59.799
and weren't here?

594
28:01.079 --> 28:02.318
Pao Bei.

595
28:02.319 --> 28:04.078
Didn't you take the day off today?

596
28:04.079 --> 28:05.480
Why are you here all of a sudden?

597
28:05.920 --> 28:08.518
Did you sneak in through the back door?

598
28:08.519 --> 28:10.078
There's a perfectly good front door,

599
28:10.079 --> 28:11.799
yet you always want to take the back.

600
28:21.240 --> 28:24.960
Seems like you really have a thing for the back door.

601
28:25.240 --> 28:26.358
Right?

602
28:26.359 --> 28:27.359
What?

603
28:30.039 --> 28:33.000
You're even wearing my clothes without asking.

604
28:36.799 --> 28:39.159
Let's go back and grab another set of bowls and chopsticks.

605
28:43.319 --> 28:45.000
What did that jerk do to you?

606
28:45.039 --> 28:46.919
Did you just let him push you around like that?

607
28:48.579 --> 28:50.140
Fuck that guy!

608
28:50.279 --> 28:51.518
Does having money make him untouchable?

609
28:51.519 --> 28:52.919
How dare he treat people like this!

610
28:54.200 --> 28:55.000
Just as well.

611
28:55.001 --> 28:56.896
We're not done settling the score from when he reported me.

612
28:56.920 --> 28:59.160
I'll settle all old scores and new debts with him today!

613
29:00.039 --> 29:00.880
Bro, what are you doing? Calm down!

614
29:00.880 --> 29:01.880
Calm down!

615
29:02.319 --> 29:03.319
Let go of me!

616
29:03.320 --> 29:05.199
What are you doing? I'm getting payback for you!

617
29:05.200 --> 29:06.640
Until I find my mom and the ring,

618
29:07.119 --> 29:08.400
what else can I do?

619
29:08.480 --> 29:10.040
I just have to bite the bullet for now.

620
29:10.119 --> 29:13.241
Besides, there are so many guys out there. Can you even take them?

621
29:13.519 --> 29:15.319
Then what do you suggest we do?

622
29:15.519 --> 29:16.519
What's your plan?

623
29:22.759 --> 29:23.440
Boss P'Eng.

624
29:23.759 --> 29:25.199
You came in pretty aggressive today.

625
29:25.920 --> 29:26.920
Have a seat first.

626
29:34.799 --> 29:36.680
Run, of course!

627
29:37.839 --> 29:38.959
Where's your backbone?

628
29:38.960 --> 29:39.960
Chickening out already?

629
29:41.519 --> 29:42.799
We're outnumbered right now.

630
29:43.079 --> 29:44.656
Going head-to-head won't solve anything.

631
29:44.680 --> 29:45.976
If we don't run, what else can we do?

632
29:46.000 --> 29:46.599
Run?

633
29:46.920 --> 29:48.359
You can run, but you can't hide.

634
29:48.799 --> 29:50.359
Doesn't he already know where you live?

635
29:50.480 --> 29:52.200
And do you know where to find your mom?

636
29:54.880 --> 29:56.440
The food here is really good.

637
29:56.599 --> 29:57.599
You should try it.

638
29:57.640 --> 29:59.680
Are you really just here to eat?

639
30:00.079 --> 30:01.079
Yeah.

640
30:01.736 --> 30:04.656
Honestly, I never really acquired a taste for the food around here,

641
30:04.680 --> 30:06.599
but the dishes here are genuinely delicious.

642
30:07.640 --> 30:08.640
Oh, right.

643
30:09.400 --> 30:11.520
You mentioned earlier that you came to catch someone.

644
30:12.000 --> 30:12.680
What happened?

645
30:12.681 --> 30:13.839
I heard from Master Chen

646
30:14.400 --> 30:15.535
that when you went for a massage last time,

647
30:15.559 --> 30:18.519
some jerk gave you "special service."

648
30:19.839 --> 30:20.839
Aren't you...

649
30:21.039 --> 30:22.279
curious who did it?

650
30:23.039 --> 30:25.839
So, did you find out who it was?

651
30:27.680 --> 30:28.720
I have a pretty good idea.

652
30:29.400 --> 30:30.400
It's definitely him.

653
30:30.839 --> 30:32.559
And who is he...?

654
30:34.759 --> 30:35.759
All right.

655
30:35.920 --> 30:37.118
Anything you can think of,

656
30:37.119 --> 30:38.240
they've already anticipated.

657
30:42.680 --> 30:43.359
Then...

658
30:43.480 --> 30:44.680
Then we fight them to the end!

659
30:47.799 --> 30:49.720
Come on, stop making trouble.

660
30:50.480 --> 30:51.799
Let's take these out first.

661
30:53.920 --> 30:54.920
You're right.

662
30:54.921 --> 30:56.480
They're customers after all,

663
30:56.799 --> 30:58.119
and we're just employees.

664
30:58.519 --> 31:00.279
We just have to serve them properly for now.

665
31:02.200 --> 31:03.440
Okay, let's go.

666
31:18.039 --> 31:19.640
Who lit your fuse today?

667
31:20.480 --> 31:21.200
I'm sorry.

668
31:21.319 --> 31:22.119
The bowls were just washed.

669
31:22.120 --> 31:23.519
His hands were a bit slippery.

670
31:24.960 --> 31:25.960
Stop right there.

671
31:29.039 --> 31:30.039
What is it?

672
31:30.559 --> 31:32.799
Did the soy sauce from that night still not wash off?

673
31:37.599 --> 31:38.599
He's the guy we're looking for!

674
31:38.600 --> 31:39.840
He's the one we're looking for!

675
31:41.960 --> 31:42.960
I know.

676
31:43.559 --> 31:44.559
You know?

677
31:47.160 --> 31:48.160
I know who it is.

678
31:49.400 --> 31:51.119
But what I really want to know is,

679
31:51.519 --> 31:53.039
why did you do it?

680
31:53.400 --> 31:54.960
Did I offend you somehow?

681
31:57.759 --> 31:59.319
Blame him if you want to blame someone.

682
31:59.920 --> 32:00.920
Blame me?

683
32:01.519 --> 32:04.000
Blame me for reporting your illegal business?

684
32:05.920 --> 32:07.240
So it really was you!

685
32:07.759 --> 32:08.759
That's right.

686
32:09.279 --> 32:10.319
It was me.

687
32:10.680 --> 32:12.240
Reporting an illegal business—

688
32:12.839 --> 32:14.239
is there something wrong with that?

689
32:15.359 --> 32:16.359
Hmm?

690
32:23.200 --> 32:24.200
Boss P'Eng!

691
32:25.759 --> 32:26.279
Young Master!

692
32:26.280 --> 32:27.360
Young Master, what's wrong?

693
32:27.559 --> 32:28.919
The spice must have gotten to him.

694
32:29.519 --> 32:30.319
Look at you.

695
32:30.319 --> 32:31.200
You can't handle spicy food.

696
32:31.201 --> 32:32.881
Why did you deliberately pick this to eat?

697
32:32.960 --> 32:34.759
If you can't take the heat, don't show off.

698
32:35.079 --> 32:36.079
Serves you right.

699
32:39.000 --> 32:40.080
Grab him and take him back!

700
32:40.319 --> 32:41.119
And the one behind him,

701
32:41.119 --> 32:42.119
bring him along too!

702
32:42.559 --> 32:43.720
Come on, cool off.

703
32:43.960 --> 32:46.440
Can't we just talk things out?

704
32:46.599 --> 32:47.319
Bring it on!

705
32:47.599 --> 32:48.640
Just try and grab me!

706
32:49.039 --> 32:50.959
You dare lay a finger on me in broad daylight?

707
32:50.960 --> 32:52.095
I'll call the police right now!

708
32:52.119 --> 32:53.119
The police?

709
32:58.079 --> 32:59.079
Young Master!

710
32:59.799 --> 33:01.039
You dare flip my table?!

711
33:01.559 --> 33:02.559
Young Master!

712
33:04.960 --> 33:05.359
Young Master!

713
33:05.359 --> 33:06.359
Stop fighting!

714
33:13.640 --> 33:14.519
Acting tough, huh?

715
33:14.519 --> 33:15.519
Young Master!

716
33:18.240 --> 33:19.240
You coward!

717
33:19.359 --> 33:21.079
Fight me one-on-one if you've got the guts!

718
33:21.200 --> 33:22.640
Ganging up on me is pathetic!

719
33:23.039 --> 33:24.039
Let him go!

720
33:24.359 --> 33:25.400
A one-on-one? You're on.

721
33:27.559 --> 33:28.559
Young Master!

722
33:32.839 --> 33:33.839
Boss P'Eng!

723
33:34.759 --> 33:35.759
Stop fighting!

724
33:35.880 --> 33:36.880
Everyone, stop!

725
33:43.000 --> 33:44.000
Please let him go.

726
33:46.119 --> 33:47.119
I'll go with you.

727
33:48.000 --> 33:49.319
I'll take full responsibility.

728
34:15.920 --> 34:18.559
Busy all day and haven't had a single bite to eat.

729
34:49.880 --> 34:51.079
Forget it.

730
34:51.519 --> 34:53.879
Once I've had enough to drink, I won't feel hungry anymore.

731
35:27.119 --> 35:28.400
Who is it?

732
35:43.519 --> 35:44.679
What's going on?

733
35:45.079 --> 35:46.320
Finally came to your senses?

734
35:48.039 --> 35:49.079
Let me in.

735
35:49.599 --> 35:51.079
We're not done talking.

736
36:12.440 --> 36:13.440
Go ahead.

737
36:14.000 --> 36:16.000
What else do you have to add?

738
36:16.599 --> 36:18.239
The money my mother owes you,

739
36:19.039 --> 36:20.400
I will definitely pay it back.

740
36:21.880 --> 36:24.000
Just please leave my friend A Pong alone,

741
36:24.519 --> 36:25.760
and my younger siblings too.

742
36:28.079 --> 36:30.639
Your friend got what he deserved.

743
36:31.800 --> 36:33.238
That and your mother owing me money

744
36:33.239 --> 36:34.719
are two completely different matters.

745
36:37.719 --> 36:38.719
Fine.

746
36:39.199 --> 36:41.159
Then will you leave my younger siblings alone?

747
36:42.800 --> 36:45.159
Let them live and go to school in peace.

748
36:48.880 --> 36:51.079
No.

749
37:02.360 --> 37:04.280
What are you glaring at me for?

750
37:09.159 --> 37:10.280
Let me ask you.

751
37:11.760 --> 37:13.800
How exactly are you going to pay me back?

752
37:28.440 --> 37:29.880
I'm asking you.

753
37:30.280 --> 37:31.840
How are you going to pay me back?

754
37:34.320 --> 37:36.800
What do you even have to your name?

755
37:44.000 --> 37:46.199
Even the clothes on your back

756
37:47.599 --> 37:49.239
belong to me.

757
38:01.239 --> 38:02.239
That's enough.

758
38:02.639 --> 38:04.199
You have nothing.

759
38:04.840 --> 38:06.360
Just keep working here,

760
38:06.559 --> 38:08.079
earn your honest money,

761
38:09.119 --> 38:10.559
so that thief of a mother of yours...

762
38:10.719 --> 38:11.719
What did you say?

763
38:14.639 --> 38:15.559
What do I have?

764
38:15.599 --> 38:16.920
Tonight, I'll show you

765
38:18.559 --> 38:19.559
what I have.

766
39:02.159 --> 39:03.159
What's the matter?

767
39:04.280 --> 39:05.639
Don't even know how to kiss?

768
39:09.079 --> 39:11.239
Is this your first time kissing a man?

769
39:21.320 --> 39:23.079
Show me what you've got.

770
39:24.239 --> 39:25.719
Don't tell me this is all you can do.

771
40:20.480 --> 40:21.719
What are you doing with that?

772
40:31.916 --> 40:33.843
[Tuesday March 10th is calling???]

773
40:35.360 --> 40:36.360
Get out.

774
40:39.840 --> 40:40.840
Get out!

775
41:06.199 --> 41:07.199
Hello?
